Third-party components
----------------------
The application ships only permissively licensed dependencies (MIT, Apache-2.0,
BSD-family). The exact inventory, versions and licence texts are recorded in:

  - licenses_ledger.json   (per-package ledger produced by the licence tooling)
  - licenses_audit.json    (audit output; a non-permissive shipped dependency
                            fails the release check)

Development-only tooling (test runners, linters, harnesses) is not part of the
release bundle and may carry other licences; it is never redistributed with the
product.

Vendored/patched crates under `patches/` retain their upstream licence headers.

Owner action: replace this notice with the executed licence text (EULA or
commercial terms) before any distribution outside the owner's organisation.
